[[File:The Heroine (Beta 20.2).png|thumb|Beta 20.2]]
The Heroine (a.k.a. Undyne the Undying) was the 3rd DT card added to the game, in '''Beta 3.9'''. Like any DT cards, she's immune to Silence. She used to be a 10/10 monster for 25G, with her ability giving her -2/-2 with each death, making her have 5 'lives' and a combined total of 30/30.
[[File:The Heroine (Beta 30.2).png|thumb|234x234px|Beta 30.2]]
In '''Beta 7.1''', she got buffed with +5/+10/+10, leaving her with 20/20 for 30G, and her ability would give -5/-5 each time, giving her only 4 'lives', but a total of a whopping 50/50. '''Beta 7.6''' changed her back, though, to 10/10 with -2/-2 each death. Only now, she's 20G. '''Beta 18.1''' dropped this further to 18G, '''Beta 20.0''' to 15G, but '''Beta 20.2''' increased it to 16G.
[[File:The Heroine (Beta 55.1).png|thumb|230x230px|Beta 55.1]]
'''Beta 30.2''' changed how Dust functioned. As a result, The Heroine was slightly reworked. She functions still the same, but is no longer a Dust monster. '''Beta 55.1''' reworked her more. Dropping to a 9/9 for 13G, she now resurrects with -3/-3, giving her just 3 'lives' with a total of 18/18. '''Beta 58.0''' turned her into a [[:Category:Royal Guard|Royal Guard]] (at the same time [[Omega Flowey]] became a [[:Category:Plant|Plant]] again). She was reworked once more as well, dropping to an even lower 8/8, but resurrecting with -2/-2 again, thus giving her 4 'lives' and a total of 20/20. She now also has Taunt by default, but this doesn't carry over into her resurrections. Instead, it is replaced with Armor during her first (at 6/6) and Transparency during her second (at 4/4). She has no additional ability during her final resurrection (at 2/2). '''Beta 61.0''' once again reworked her even more. She kept her Taunt and stats, but had her cost reduced by 2, to 11. Now, if you had a card of each non-DT rarity in your dustpile, so base, common, rare, epic, legendary, and token, she would resurrect with -2/-2 base stats and no Taunt, bringing her back to a total of 20/20 again.

